#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:5 151fc04a608f4e019b0d3511426d9c89
msgid "Tuning QuickStart"
msgstr "调参快速入门"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:7 ccea26e2f6ac4e0da9a11fc6d511098b
msgid ""
"This article provides information to help you get started with airframe "
"tuning. It includes an overview of the main steps, tools and concepts."
msgstr "本文提供帮助您开始机身调参的信息，包括主要步骤、工具和概念的概述。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:11 42f58b1ce62b4cc1b531123b67799f83
msgid "How to tune the airframe"
msgstr "如何调参机身"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:13 47e379449a4e417a9f784e4812ff177c
msgid ""
"With the default PID settings, Plane will fly the majority of lightweight RC"
" airframes (not full size, full speed airframes) safely, right out of the "
"box. To fly well, with tight navigation and reliable performance in wind, "
"you'll want to tune your autopilot."
msgstr ""
"使用默认PID设置，Plane 可以安全地飞行大多数轻型遥控机身（非全尺寸、全速机身），开箱即用。要实现精确导航和在风中可靠飞行，您需要调参飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:18 fb07b8b1516c41a9a1cbb4f1546a40f8
msgid ""
"The most important configuration is Roll and Pitch tuning, as this is "
"essential for responsive and stable flight as well as effective navigation. "
"The best way to tune the roll and pitch is to use :ref:`Automatic Tuning "
"with AUTOTUNE <automatic-tuning-with-autotune>` (a flight mode that uses "
"changes in flight attitude input by the pilot to learn the key values "
"needed)."
msgstr ""
"最重要的配置是横滚和俯仰调参，这对于响应灵敏和稳定的飞行以及有效导航至关重要。调参横滚和俯仰的最佳方法是使用 :ref:`AUTOTUNE自动调参 "
"<automatic-tuning-with-autotune>` （一种使用飞手输入的飞行姿态变化来学习所需关键值的飞行模式）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:26 daaaa9e6c00d4005a0f756a2e0aac0e2
msgid ""
"To use AUTOTUNE you must to be able to fly the aircraft. Plane will fly the "
"majority of lightweight RC airframes right out of the box. We also provide "
":ref:`configuration values for many common aircraft <configuration-files-"
"for-common-airframes>` that you can use to get your aircraft flying before "
"doing further tuning."
msgstr ""
"要使用AUTOTUNE，您必须能够飞行飞机。Plane 可以开箱即用地飞行大多数轻型遥控机身。我们还提供了 :ref:`许多常见飞机的配置值 "
"<configuration-files-for-common-airframes>`，您可以使用这些值在进行进一步调参之前先让飞机飞起来。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:31 636be674fd8e498ab013ae4f5d33a778
msgid ""
"If AUTOTUNE doesn't work with your plane, a fully manual approach is "
"described in the :ref:`Manual Roll, Pitch and Yaw Controller Tuning Guide "
"<new-roll-and-pitch-tuning>` or :ref:`here for firmware versions before 4.1 "
"<roll-pitch-controller-tuning>`."
msgstr ""
"如果AUTOTUNE对您的飞机不起作用，可以参考 :ref:`手动横滚、俯仰和偏航控制器调参指南 <new-roll-and-pitch-"
"tuning>`，或 :ref:`4.1版本之前的固件版本 <roll-pitch-controller-tuning>` 的完全手动方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:34 dc63f1fcd4ec4114adeabc46212505b3
msgid ""
"After tuning the Roll, Pitch (and optionally yaw) you should tune the height"
" controller using the :ref:`TECS tuning guide <tecs-total-energy-control-"
"system-for-speed-height-tuning-guide>` and the horizontal navigation using "
"the \\ :ref:`L1 controller tuning guide <navigation-tuning>`."
msgstr ""
"调参横滚、俯仰（以及可选的偏航）后，应使用 :ref:`TECS调参指南 <tecs-total-energy-control-system-for-"
"speed-height-tuning-guide>` 调参高度控制器，并使用 :ref:`L1控制器调参指南 <navigation-tuning>`"
" 调参水平导航。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:38 acd575fd2ddb4b1996f03b9198660ed7
msgid ""
"Information on how to tune other aspects of Plane are linked from the "
":ref:`Tuning landing page. <common-tuning>`"
msgstr "有关如何调参Plane其他方面的信息，请参见 :ref:`调参主页 <common-tuning>` 的链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:42 5f59caf17e5145459e85e2cb9fb2d15b
msgid "Mission Planner configuration screens"
msgstr "Mission Planner 配置界面"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:44 d0c80a7a3afe4ae1b24bfa3eed483a3e
msgid ""
"this section applies only to firmware versions prior to 4.1. This section "
"will be updated in the future for 4.1 and later releases. You can configure "
"the new parameters (See :ref:`Manual Roll, Pitch and Yaw Controller Tuning "
"Guide <new-roll-and-pitch-tuning>`) directly in the Mission Planner "
"CONFIG->Full Parameter List tab."
msgstr ""
"本节仅适用于4.1之前的固件版本。本节将在未来更新以涵盖4.1及更高版本。您可以直接在Mission Planner CONFIG->Full "
"Parameter List选项卡中配置新参数（参见 :ref:`手动横滚、俯仰和偏航控制器调参指南 <new-roll-and-pitch-"
"tuning>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:46 a79a9d591a724b46bf739f1c1c5c7009
msgid ""
"The *Mission Planner* provides access to all configuration and tuning "
"parameters through the CONFIG/TUNING section. The column on the left links "
"to the full parameter set. The screen on the right lists some (but not all) "
"of the more commonly modified parameters. You can use either side to make "
"the same parameter change. Parameter updates are sent to the connected board"
" as soon as you press \"write params\", many affect the current flight (if "
"any) immediately, and are written to permanent storage so they survive power"
" cycling."
msgstr ""
"*Mission Planner* "
"通过CONFIG/TUNING部分提供对所有配置和调参参数的访问。左侧的列链接到完整的参数集。右侧的屏幕列出了一些（但不是全部）更常修改的参数。您可以使用任一侧进行相同的参数更改。按下「write"
" params」后，参数更新立即发送到已连接的控制器，许多参数会立即影响当前飞行（如果有），并写入永久存储，在断电后保留。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:58 fd8096ca41d24536a224550022d69ead
msgid "Mission Planner: CONFIG/TUNINGPlane Pids Screen"
msgstr "Mission Planner：CONFIG/TUNING Plane PID 界面"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:60 5388c2e3dbd149bfafcd22c20cbb9b04
msgid ""
"The starting point for Plane tuning is via the Plane PIDs screen shown "
"above. This is where you can tune the Servo Roll and Servo Pitch PID gains "
"to enable flight in FBWA mode, and also enable tuning of the L1 Control for "
"more accurate horizontal positioning."
msgstr ""
"Plane 调参的起点是上图所示的Plane "
"PIDs界面。在这里您可以调参舵机横滚和舵机俯仰PID增益以启用FBWA模式飞行，并启用L1控制调参以获得更精确的水平定位。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:65 772c3f473ec148178609502051ef7535
msgid ""
"You can also load and save configuration files (to your PC) from the "
"*Advanced Parameters* screen. Configuration files are versioned - an older "
"parameter file found by Plane is ignored if the parameter version number is "
"not current."
msgstr ""
"您还可以从*高级参数*界面加载和保存配置文件（到您的PC）。配置文件是有版本控制的——如果Plane找到的旧参数文件的参数版本号不是当前版本，则会忽略它。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:70 9ac38d1daa2243f490f26594b77a70d9
msgid ""
"You will note that several of these parameters are PID (Proportional, "
"Integral, Differential) settings which are explained in the next section."
msgstr "您会注意到这些参数中有几个是PID（比例、积分、微分）设置，将在下一节中解释。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:75 1d9f2f784ca84da8a74ee72b777c5d20
msgid "PID gain values"
msgstr "PID 增益值"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:77 861d02f868ff4d9183e94a6ffab68c6a
msgid ""
"The control of roll or pitch angle is adjusted using a `Proportional-"
"Integral-Derivative (PID) Controller "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PID_controller>`__."
msgstr ""
"横滚或俯仰角的控制通过 `比例-积分-微分（PID）控制器 "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/PID_controller>`__ 调整。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:80 3563fa293c924b6ca82cbeeac22311aa
msgid ""
"The final control applied to the plane's control surface, is a combination "
"of the effects of four gain values:"
msgstr "施加到飞机操纵面的最终控制量，是四个增益值效果的组合："

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:83 7979ff1bb8a84f4f8d8978ecd6cc32dd
msgid ""
"*Proportional gain (P)* is the simplest form of control, it is the "
"\"present\" error. Autopilot wants 10 degrees of pitch, has 5 degrees, that "
"is an error of 5: apply some amount of elevator (the amount applied for the "
"amount of error is determined - scaled - by the P number)."
msgstr ""
"*比例增益（P）* "
"是最简单的控制形式，是「当前」误差。飞控想要10度俯仰，实际有5度，误差为5：施加一定量的升降舵（施加的量由P值确定——缩放——与误差量相关）。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:88 99c1ab96b56d497db2ca3b33e8eaec12
msgid ""
"*Integral gain (I)* takes into consideration previous errors and is able to "
"compensate for steady errors. It can be thought of as an automatic trim "
"adjustment. The disadvantage with the \"I\" gain is that because it is "
"always reacting to past errors, it reduces damping of the control loop as it"
" is always playing 'catchup'."
msgstr ""
"*积分增益（I）* "
"考虑过去的误差，能够补偿稳态误差。可以将其视为自动配平调整。「I」增益的缺点是，由于它总是对过去的误差做出反应，它会降低控制回路的阻尼，因为它总是在「追赶」。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:93 92f0999896014157bd9d8c30feda1ed2
msgid ""
"*Derivative gain (D)* adds damping because it feeds back the rate of change "
"of the angle. It can also be thought of as attempting to anticipate future "
"changes in angle. The disadvantage of the \"D\" gain is that it increases "
"the amount of noise driving the servo and if turned up too high will cause "
"rapid pitch or roll oscillation that can in some cases damage the aircraft."
msgstr ""
"*微分增益（D）* "
"增加阻尼，因为它反馈角度变化率。也可以将其视为试图预测角度的未来变化。「D」增益的缺点是它增加了驱动舵机的噪声量，如果调得太高，会导致快速的俯仰或横滚振荡，在某些情况下可能损坏飞机。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:99 ce768e5751c14aaa8b8a49383fc6c4b3
msgid ""
"*FeedForward gain (FF)* is perhaps the most important since it directly "
"drives the control surfaces from the demanded rate input from the autopilot,"
" much as the pilot does in manual mode. The P,I, and D rate error-based "
"contributions add to this to correct any trim,CG, or external disturbance "
"impacts."
msgstr ""
"*前馈增益（FF）* "
"可能是最重要的，因为它直接根据飞控的需求角速率输入驱动操纵面，就像飞手在手动模式下所做的那样。P、I和D基于角速率误差的贡献加在此基础上，以纠正配平、重心或外部干扰的影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:104
#: 503c37776f644a9fa193ad7a7cbf8b8a
msgid ""
"Tuning FF, P, PI or PID values can improve how quickly an observed error "
"between desired attitude (pitch, speed, bearing, whatever) and actual "
"attitude can be canceled out, without undue oscillation."
msgstr "调参FF、P、PI或PID值可以改善在观察到的期望姿态（俯仰、速度、方位，无论什么）和实际姿态之间的误差消除速度，而不会产生过度振荡。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:110
#: b2de4a203b6741fd873fca49fc8df650
msgid ""
"A simple configuration can just specify a P term (I and D is zero and "
"``INT_MAX`` is not used when I is zero) in firmware versions before 4.1. And"
" FF/P term with I=FF for firmware versions 4.1 and later, with D=0."
msgstr ""
"简单配置只需指定P项（当I为零时，I和D为零且不使用 "
"``INT_MAX``），适用于4.1之前的固件版本。对于4.1及更高版本的固件，使用FF/P项且I=FF，D=0。"

#: ../../source/docs/tuning-quickstart.rst:113
#: 8db97384e7e846e59f81e88600c26f7c
msgid ""
"Refer to :ref:`Manual Roll, Pitch and Yaw Controller Tuning Guide <new-roll-"
"and-pitch-tuning>` or :ref:`here for firmware versions before 4.1 <roll-"
"pitch-controller-tuning>`. for more information"
msgstr ""
"更多信息请参考 :ref:`手动横滚、俯仰和偏航控制器调参指南 <new-roll-and-pitch-tuning>` 或 "
":ref:`4.1之前固件版本 <roll-pitch-controller-tuning>`。"
